# Break the Spell {W}: "If a permanent you controlled ... was destroyed this way, draw a card." Bot1 puts its own Pacifism on
# Bot2's Ornithopter and then destroys it with Break the Spell: the enchantment was a permanent Bot1 controlled (the Ornithopter
# is Bot2's), so Bot1 draws a card (CR 701.8a, 608.2c). Its Pacifism is gone, so the Ornithopter is free again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Pacifism
Break the Spell
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Plains x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pacifism.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#3.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Break the Spell.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Pacifism)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
Bot1.Graveyard = Break the Spell; Pacifism
